pct = body('**Elastic designs versus the aligner-only control. **At equal molar distalization the canine had moved 0.36 ± 0.15 mm mesially without elastics and 0.12–0.17 mm with the elastic designs, so each design held the canine 0.19–0.25 mm further distally (all patients; Holm p ≤ 0.008) and the incisal edge 0.19–0.23 mm further palatally (all patients; p = 0.014), and intruded the incisal edge 0.18–0.23 mm more (p ≤ 0.006).')
